#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Validated Value"
msgstr "验证值"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Category"
msgstr "类别"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Description and Tuning Guidance"
msgstr "描述与调优指南"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking`"
msgstr "`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "model path"
msgstr "模型路径"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Model-specific"
msgstr "模型特定"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Specifies the model weight path passed to `vllm serve`. Because `--served-"
"model-name` is not set in the script, API requests must use "
"`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking` as the model name unless you add an explicit "
"served-model-name override; see the FAQ in Chapter 10."
msgstr ""
"指定传递给 `vllm serve` 的模型权重路径。由于脚本中未设置 `--served-model-name`，API 请求必须使用 "
"`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking` 作为模型名称，除非您添加了显式的 served-model-name 覆盖；请参阅第 10 "
"章的常见问题解答。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`"
msgstr "`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`1024`"
msgstr "`1024`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Configures the HCCL communication buffer used by distributed NPU "
"communication. This document validates `1024`; other values need separate "
"throughput, TTFT, TPOT, and HCCL stability validation."
msgstr ""
"配置分布式 NPU 通信所使用的 HCCL 通信缓冲区。本文档验证了 `1024`；其他值需要单独进行吞吐量、TTFT、TPOT 和 HCCL "
"稳定性验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE`"
msgstr "`TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Version-sensitive / Performance"
msgstr "版本敏感 / 性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Enables task queue scheduling on Ascend. This document validates `1`; other "
"values or version changes need startup and first-request validation."
msgstr "在昇腾上启用任务队列调度。本文档验证了 `1`；其他值或版本变更需要启动和首次请求验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`OMP_PROC_BIND`"
msgstr "`OMP_PROC_BIND`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Avoids overly strict OpenMP CPU binding. This document validates `false`; "
"other values need separate CPU affinity, NPU health, and HCCL stability "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"避免过于严格的 OpenMP CPU 绑定。本文档验证了 `false`；其他值需要单独进行 CPU 亲和性、NPU 健康和 HCCL 稳定性验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`"
msgstr "`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`AIV`"
msgstr "`AIV`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Enables the AIV communication path. This document validates `AIV`; other "
"values need separate throughput and latency validation."
msgstr "启用 AIV 通信路径。本文档验证了 `AIV`；其他值需要单独进行吞吐量和延迟验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`"
msgstr "`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`expandable_segments:True`"
msgstr "`expandable_segments:True`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Memory / Performance"
msgstr "内存 / 性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Reduces NPU memory fragmentation. This document validates "
"`expandable_segments:True`; other allocator settings need separate startup, "
"memory, and runtime stability validation."
msgstr ""
"减少 NPU 内存碎片。本文档验证了 `expandable_segments:True`；其他分配器设置需要单独进行启动、内存和运行时稳定性验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`SERVER_PORT` and `--port`"
msgstr "`SERVER_PORT` 和 `--port`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`8000`"
msgstr "`8000`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Sets the OpenAI-compatible service port. The documentation generator maps "
"`DEFAULT_PORT` in the YAML to `8000`; update the curl examples if you change"
" this value."
msgstr ""
"设置 OpenAI 兼容服务的端口。文档生成器将 YAML 中的 `DEFAULT_PORT` 映射为 `8000`；如果您更改此值，请更新 curl "
"示例。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`--tensor-parallel-size`"
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`16`"
msgstr "`16`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Model-specific / Performance"
msgstr "模型特定 / 性能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Uses all 16 NPUs on one Atlas 800 A3 node. This document validates `tp16`; "
"other topologies need separate memory, accuracy, and communication "
"validation."
msgstr "使用单个 Atlas 800 A3 节点上的全部 16 个 NPU。本文档验证了 `tp16`；其他拓扑需要单独进行内存、精度和通信验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`--max-model-len`"
msgstr "`--max-model-len`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`8192`"
msgstr "`8192`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum input plus output tokens for one request and determines KV "
"cache reservation. This document validates `8192`; larger values need "
"separate NPU memory, accuracy, and performance validation. Keep it close to "
"the real maximum input and output length for your workload."
msgstr ""
"设置单个请求的最大输入加输出 token 数，并决定 KV 缓存预留大小。本文档验证了 `8192`；更大的值需要单独进行 NPU "
"内存、精度和性能验证。请使其接近您工作负载的实际最大输入和输出长度。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Limits tokens processed in one scheduler step. This document validates "
"`8192`; other values need separate memory, TTFT, TPOT, and throughput "
"validation."
msgstr "限制单个调度步骤中处理的 token 数。本文档验证了 `8192`；其他值需要单独进行内存、TTFT、TPOT 和吞吐量验证。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`--max-num-seqs`"
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "`12`"
msgstr "`12`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Limits active sequences scheduled at the same time. This document validates "
"`12`; higher values need separate tail-latency and throughput validation. "
"The reference sweep in Chapter 8 shows concurrency 16 causes severe TTFT "
"growth; validate tail latency before raising it in production."
msgstr ""
"限制同时调度的活动序列数。本文档验证了 `12`；更高的值需要单独进行尾延迟和吞吐量验证。第 8 章的参考扫描显示并发数 16 会导致 TTFT "
"严重增长；在生产环境中提高该值之前请先验证尾延迟。"

