#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Keep `--max-model-len` close to the real maximum input and output length, "
"and reduce `--max-num-seqs` first when memory pressure is high. The "
"validated scope of this single-node baseline covers up to 2K input / 2K "
"output in Chapter 8."
msgstr ""
"保持`--max-model-len`接近实际最大输入和输出长度，当内存压力较高时，首先减少`--max-num-"
"seqs`。此单节点基线的验证范围涵盖第8章中最多2K输入/2K输出的场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "Low Latency"
msgstr "低延迟"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Reduce `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-batched-tokens` from the validated "
"baseline (`12` and `8192`) to reduce queueing delay. In the Chapter 8 "
"concurrency sweep, concurrency 1-4 kept mean TTFT below 1s; validate TTFT, "
"TPOT, and tail latency against the target latency SLO."
msgstr ""
"从已验证的基线（`12`和`8192`）减少`--max-num-seqs`和`--max-num-batched-"
"tokens`，以降低排队延迟。在第8章的并发扫描中，并发数1-4将平均TTFT保持在1秒以下；请根据目标延迟SLO验证TTFT、TPOT和尾延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid "High Throughput"
msgstr "高吞吐量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:185
msgid ""
"Increase `--max-num-seqs` gradually and benchmark with a request rate close "
"to the real workload. In the 1K/1K concurrency sweep in Chapter 8, "
"concurrency 8 gave the best output throughput; validate tail latency before "
"using higher concurrency in production."
msgstr ""
"逐步增加`--max-num-"
"seqs`，并使用接近实际工作负载的请求速率进行基准测试。在第8章的1K/1K并发扫描中，并发数8获得了最佳输出吞吐量；在生产环境中使用更高并发前，请验证尾延迟。"

