#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:369
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Q: API returns `{\"error\":\"Model not found\"}` or `404` when requesting "
"with `model: \"Kimi-K2-Thinking\"`?**"
msgstr ""
"**问：使用 `model: \"Kimi-K2-Thinking\"` 请求时，API返回 `{\"error\":\"Model not "
"found\"}` 或 `404`？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K2-Thinking.md:371
msgid ""
"A: The server registers the model under its full path "
"`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking` by default. When the request uses the short "
"name `Kimi-K2-Thinking` without `--served-model-name` override, the server "
"cannot resolve the model ID. Use `\"model\": "
"\"moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking\"` in requests, or start the server with "
"`--served-model-name Kimi-K2-Thinking` to enable the short name."
msgstr ""
"答：服务器默认使用完整路径 `moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking` 注册模型。当请求使用短名称 `Kimi-K2-Thinking`"
" 且未通过 `--served-model-name` 覆盖时，服务器无法解析模型ID。请在请求中使用 `\"model\": "
"\"moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking\"`，或使用 `--served-model-name Kimi-K2-Thinking` "
"启动服务器以启用短名称。"

